{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NullWake</strong> is not just a horror game \u2014 it is a true test of your nerves.<br>You wake up in an abandoned hospital where everything seems real, yet with every step the line between reality and nightmare begins to fade. The story pulls you deeper into a world of mystery: a ghost town, parallel universes, and enemies you cannot predict.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>A powerful storyline</strong> \u2014 a narrative that keeps you engaged and makes you question every choice.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>High-quality graphics</strong> \u2014 detailed environments that create a dark and realistic atmosphere.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Unpredictable jump scares</strong> \u2014 moments of pure terror that strike when you least expect them.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Heart-stopping atmosphere</strong> \u2014 fear does not only come from the scares, but from the silence, tension, and suffocating dread.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Challenging puzzles and quests</strong> \u2014 every step forward requires thought, exploration, and solving complex tasks that test both your logic and your courage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>What awaits you:</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of haunting locations: a hospital, a ghost town, forests, and abandoned houses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heavy, oppressive atmosphere that never lets you feel safe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies that appear where you least expect them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex quests and puzzles hidden within the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological pressure that pushes you to the edge of panic.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NullWake</strong> is a game where true horror hides in the atmosphere itself.<br>Are you ready to feel your heartbeat slow down?</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4073560?t=1761038019","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4073560?t=1761038019","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073560/e2769b9d5712e56d5f3d97f324ef6b1b0c05966a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761038019","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073560/e2769b9d5712e56d5f3d97f324ef6b1b0c05966a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761038019","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NullWake</strong> is not just a horror game \u2014 it is a true test of your nerves.<br>You wake up in an abandoned hospital where everything seems real, yet with every step the line between reality and nightmare begins to fade. The story pulls you deeper into a world of mystery: a ghost town, parallel universes, and enemies you cannot predict.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>A powerful storyline</strong> \u2014 a narrative that keeps you engaged and makes you question every choice.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>High-quality graphics</strong> \u2014 detailed environments that create a dark and realistic atmosphere.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Unpredictable jump scares</strong> \u2014 moments of pure terror that strike when you least expect them.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Heart-stopping atmosphere</strong> \u2014 fear does not only come from the scares, but from the silence, tension, and suffocating dread.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Challenging puzzles and quests</strong> \u2014 every step forward requires thought, exploration, and solving complex tasks that test both your logic and your courage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>What awaits you:</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of haunting locations: a hospital, a ghost town, forests, and abandoned houses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heavy, oppressive atmosphere that never lets you feel safe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies that appear where you least expect them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex quests and puzzles hidden within the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological pressure that pushes you to the edge of panic.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NullWake</strong> is a game where true horror hides in the atmosphere itself.<br>Are you ready to feel your heartbeat slow down?</h2>","developers":["Samadov Adalat","Mammadli Kanan"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073560/e79af7513ef1b435ab242d73df7a85aafcde7e79/header.jpg?t=1761038019","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Nullwake","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2500K / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970 / AMD Radeon R9 280 (4 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD reco